. I forgive. I forgive.","start":541.3,"end":552.62,"words":[{"text":"I","start":541.3,"end":541.66},{"text":"forgive","start":541.66,"end":542.1},{"text":"my","start":542.1,"end":542.42},{"text":"past.","start":542.42,"end":543.32},{"text":"I","start":544.52,"end":544.66},{"text":"forgive","start":544.66,"end":545},{"text":"my","start":545,"end":545.3},{"text":"thoughts","start":545.3,"end":545.56},{"text":"of","start":545.56,"end":545.88},{"text":"the","start":545.88,"end":546},{"text":"future.","start":546,"end":546.9},{"text":"I","start":549.42,"end":549.44},{"text":"forgive.","start":549.44,"end":550.42},{"text":"I","start":551.8,"end":551.82},{"text":"forgive.","start":551.82,"end":552.62}]},{"text":"Finally, you can place your right palm on the top of your head, pressing down and raising your fingertips.","start":561.04,"end":567.86,"words":[{"text":"Finally,","start":561.04,"end":561.64},{"text":"you","start":561.64,"end":561.64},{"text":"can","start":561.64,"end":561.74},{"text":"place","start":561.74,"end":562.04},{"text":"your","start":562.04,"end":562.34},{"text":"right","start":562.34,"end":562.58},{"text":"palm","start":562.58,"end":562.98},{"text":"on","start":562.98,"end":563.4},{"text":"the","start":563.4,"end":563.56},{"text":"top","start":563.56,"end":563.74},{"text":"of","start":563.74,"end":563.92},{"text":"your","start":563.92,"end":564.12},{"text":"head,","start":564.12,"end":564.68},{"text":"pressing","start":565.48,"end":565.74},{"text":"down","start":565.74,"end":566.18},{"text":"and","start":566.18,"end":566.4},{"text":"raising","start":566.4,"end":566.7},{"text":"your","start":566.7,"end":566.92},{"text":"fingertips.","start":566.92,"end":567.86}]},{"text":"You can rotate your palm in a clockwise direction, moving your scalp, massaging a bit.","start":571.8,"end":581.04,"words":[{"text":"You","start":571.8,"end":571.88},{"text":"can","start":571.88,"end":572.08},{"text":"rotate","start":572.08,"end":572.4},{"text":"your","start":572.4,"en